    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1shuffle__iterator" kindref="compound">shuffle_iterator</ref></computeroutput> is an iterator which generates a sequence of values representing a random permutation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>IndexType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the index to shuffle. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BijectionFunc</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The bijection to use. This should be a bijective function that maps [0..n) -&gt; [0..n). It must be deterministic and stateless. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
  </compounddef>
